{"unit_id":"tag:06GB:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n由下面的引理，常可将涉及 <MATH_0001> 中满射（surjective）的环映射（ring maps）的论证归结为小扩张（small extensions）的情形。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"ring maps","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"small extensions","target_term":"小扩张"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"环映射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"ring maps","target_term":"环映射","context":"引理所处理的映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"small extensions","target_term":"小扩张","context":"归结后的扩张，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06GE:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是 <MATH_0002> 中的满射环映射（surjective ring map）。则 <MATH_0003> 可分解为小扩张（small extensions）的复合（composition）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"surjective ring map","target_term":"满射环映射"},{"source_term":"small extensions","target_term":"小扩张"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"surjective ring map","target_term":"满射环映射","context":"分解定理的输入，待决。"},{"source_term":"small extensions","target_term":"小扩张","context":"分解因子，待决。"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"分解的复合，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06GE:proof","translation":"令 <MATH_0001> 为 <MATH_0002> 的核（kernel）。极大理想（maximal ideal）<MATH_0003> 是幂零（nilpotent）的，因为 <MATH_0004> 是阿廷（Artinian）的，设 <MATH_0005>。于是得到分解（factorization）\n<MATH_0006>\n将 <MATH_0007> 分解为满射（surjective）映射（maps）的复合（composition），其核（kernels）均被极大理想（maximal ideal）零化（annihilated）。因此只需在 <MATH_0008> 本身为这样的映射（map）时证明引理，即<SPACE_0001>在 <MATH_0009> 被 <MATH_0010> 零化（annihilated）时。在此情形下，<MATH_0011> 是一个 <MATH_0012> 向量空间（vector space），其维数（dimension）是有限（finite）的，见《代数》（Algebra）中的引理 <REF_0001>。取一组基（basis）<MATH_0013>（属于作为 <MATH_0015> 向量空间（vector space）的 <MATH_0014>），得到分解（factorization）\n<MATH_0016>\n将 <MATH_0017> 分解为小扩张（small extensions）的复合（composition）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"maximal ideal","target_term":"极大理想"},{"source_term":"nilpotent","target_term":"幂零"},{"source_term":"Artinian","target_term":"阿廷"},{"source_term":"factorization","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"kernels","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"maximal ideal","target_term":"极大理想"},{"source_term":"annihilated","target_term":"零化"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"annihilated","target_term":"零化"},{"source_term":"vector space","target_term":"向量空间"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"《代数》"},{"source_term":"basis","target_term":"基"},{"source_term":"vector space","target_term":"向量空间"},{"source_term":"factorization","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"small extensions","target_term":"小扩张"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核","context":"小扩张分解，待决。"},{"source_term":"maximal ideal","target_term":"极大理想","context":"小扩张分解，待决。"},{"source_term":"nilpotent","target_term":"幂零","context":"极大理想性质