{"unit_id":"tag:06GB:prose-0004","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下一个引理说明，对于局部（local）<MATH_0001> 代数（algebra）上的模（module），若其剩余域（residue field）为 <MATH_0002>，则可用它在 <MATH_0003> 上的长度（length）计算其长度（length）。为解释陈述中的记号，令 <MATH_0004> 为固定有限环映射（finite ring map）<MATH_0005> 的像（image）。注意 <MATH_0006> 是环（rings）的有限扩张（finite extension）。因此 <MATH_0007> 是域（field），而 <MATH_0008> 是域（fields）的有限扩张（finite extension），见《代数》（Algebra）中的引理 <REF_0001>。此外，因为 <MATH_0009> 是满射（surjective）的，可见其核（kernel）是极大理想（maximal ideal）<MATH_0010>。于是\n<MATH_0011>\n在经典情形（classical case）下有 <MATH_0012>。记号 <MATH_0013> 在本章中始终固定。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"residue field","target_term":"剩余域"},{"source_term":"length","target_term":"长度"},{"source_term":"length","target_term":"长度"},{"source_term":"finite ring map","target_term":"有限环映射"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"finite extension","target_term":"有限扩张"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"fields","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"finite extension","target_term":"有限扩张"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"《代数》"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"maximal ideal","target_term":"极大理想"},{"source_term":"classical case","target_term":"经典情形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"局部代数，待决。"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"模的基环，待决。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"长度计算，待决。"},{"source_term":"residue field","target_term":"剩余域","context":"长度计算，待决。"},{"source_term":"length","target_term":"长度","context":"模的长度，待决。"},{"source_term":"finite ring map","target_term":"有限环映射","context":"固定映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像","context":"固定映射的像，待决。"},{"source_term":"rings","target_